This page keeps the agent loop in the Durable Object and uses the container as a tool. To run a CLI agent such as Claude Code or Codex inside the container instead, use the [Container harness](/agents/harnesses/container/). For the trade-offs, refer to [Harness](/agents/concepts/harness/.
Use the Container harness (experimental) when you want a CLI agent, such as Claude Code or Codex, with its own tools and plugins. The CLI runs in a [Container](/containers/). `ContainerHarness` drives it from a Durable Object, which keeps the session and the credentials. For how this differs from a harness that runs in the Durable Object, refer to [Harness](/agents/concepts/harness/.
If you control the agent loop, use a harness that runs in the Durable Object, such as [Pi](/agents/harnesses/pi/), and give it a [sandbox](/agents/tools/sandbox/) as a tool. For the trade-offs between the two, refer to [Harness](/agents/concepts/harness/.
